  <compounddef id="group__BLAKE2" kind="group">
    <compoundname>BLAKE2</compoundname>
    <title>Algorithms - BLAKE2</title>
      <sectiondef kind="func">
      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__BLAKE2_1gaaf6561f8d08663ab210594bda385ad1d" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>int</type>
        <definition>int wc_InitBlake2b</definition>
        <argsstring>(Blake2b *b2b, word32 digestSz)</argsstring>
        <name>wc_InitBlake2b</name>
        <param>
          <type>Blake2b *</type>
          <declname>b2b</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>word32</type>
          <declname>digestSz</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>This function initializes a Blake2b structure for use with the Blake2 hash function. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>この関数はBlake2 Hash関数で使用するためのBlake2b構造を初期化します。</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>0 Returned upon successfully initializing the Blake2b structure and setting the digest size.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>b2b</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>pointer to the Blake2b structure to initialize </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>digestSz</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>length of the blake 2 digest to implement</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<emphasis>Example</emphasis> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Blake2b<sp/>b2b;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>initialize<sp/>Blake2b<sp/>structure<sp/>with<sp/>64<sp/>byte<sp/>digest</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">wc_InitBlake2b(&amp;b2b,<sp/>64);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__BLAKE2_1gad6ddadab52a5eb3707d390343980a7a9" kindref="member">wc_Blake2bUpdate</ref></para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>0 Blake2B構造の初期化に成功し、ダイジェストサイズを設定したときに返されます。 </para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>b2b</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>初期化するためにBlake2b構造へのポインタ <emphasis>Example</emphasis> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Blake2b<sp/>b2b;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>initialize<sp/>Blake2b<sp/>structure<sp/>with<sp/>64<sp/>byte<sp/>digest</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">wc_InitBlake2b(&amp;b2b,<sp/>64);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__BLAKE2_1gad6ddadab52a5eb3707d390343980a7a9" kindref="member">wc_Blake2bUpdate</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
